abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital resources associated with the article \
  'Retrieving and typesetting Figshare metadata for LaTeX'. Figshare is an \
  online research data sharing platform. The article discusses new resources \
  for working with Figshare metadata and LaTeX. A Python fetch script \
  automates metadata downloads. A LaTeX style file then provides an API for \
  parsing and typesetting the metadata."
